{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1120805001:1":{"text":"商人先生，打听一下！大家最近在谈论的荒矛老爷到底是谁？","source_cn":"商人先生，打听一下！大家最近在谈论的荒矛老爷到底是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22272CF2E7C8D699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120805002:1":{"text":"哦……你们几个也想去悬赏的热闹？要不要买些路上的防身物品？斗篷、抓钩、盐渍的兽肉，应有尽有！","source_cn":"哦……你们几个也想去悬赏的热闹？要不要买些路上的防身物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1E118E59E05FFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120805003:1":{"text":"谢谢你的好意，但我们只想知道荒矛老爷的事。","source_cn":"谢谢你的好意，但我们只想知道荒矛老爷的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDE0364696578CEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120805004:1":{"text":"老爷的事我也不知道，我只是个商人，还没有被称为“老爷”的尊贵人物亲自招待的资格。","source_cn":"老爷的事我也不知道，我只是个商人，还没有被称为“老爷”...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4BAF8238C89B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120805005:1":{"text":"不过，那些赏金猎人们倒像是盯上了刚宰的牛肉，像苍蝇一样围绕过来了。","source_cn":"不过，那些赏金猎人们倒像是盯上了刚宰的牛肉，像苍蝇一样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4240839687524E39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120805006:1":{"text":"完成悬赏的报酬一定不菲。不然赏金猎人也不会投那么多本金来我们这里购置装备。","source_cn":"完成悬赏的报酬一定不菲。不然赏金猎人也不会投那么多本金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928D97A7D37DBAB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120805007:1":{"text":"另外，我听到一个传闻：据说，<style=\"highlight\">荒矛老爷从不亲自露面</style>，而那些试图打探他真正身份的人，再也没有出现……","source_cn":"另外，我听到一个传闻：据说，<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CB0D54CAAD04A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120805008:1":{"text":"——那么，作为情报费，请付铜币三枚，谢谢惠顾！","source_cn":"——那么，作为情报费，请付铜币三枚，谢谢惠顾！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x175EAD1EDBB35BAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"},"speaker:行商贝尼迪":{"text":"行商贝尼迪","source":"行商贝尼迪","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}